<title>UK: C&amp;W to rise on Deutsche Telekom talks.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W to rise on Deutsche Telekom talks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cable &amp; Wireless Plc are expected to be marked higher on Wednesday after Deutsche Telekom AG said it was in talks with the British telecommunications concern, dealers said.</p>
</text>
